.TH CODE2PDF 1 "2026" "code2pdf" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
code2pdf \- print source code to PDF with a contents page and CJK support
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B code2pdf
.B \-s
.I FILE
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B code2pdf
.B \-a
.I DIR
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B code2pdf
converts one file, or every selected source file under a directory, into a PDF with
syntax highlighting, line numbers and bundled IBM Plex fonts.
.PP
With
.BR \-a ,
the result is
.IR DIR/merged.pdf :
a contents page grouped by folder with clickable page numbers and the printing date
(and git commit), then each file on a new page with its language, line count and last
change. Big directories are rendered in parts in separate processes to bound memory.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI "\-s, \-\-single " FILE
Convert one file to
.I NAME.pdf
in the current directory.
.TP
.BI "\-a, \-\-all " DIR
Convert all selected files in
.I DIR
to
.IR DIR/merged.pdf .
.TP
.BI "\-o, \-\-output " PDF
Write the PDF here instead (a directory: the default name inside it).
.TP
.BI \-\-exclude " GLOB"
Leave out matching files and folders; wins over every other rule.
.TP
.BI \-\-include " GLOB"
Also include matching files: other types, hidden files, files in skipped folders
(a skipped folder must be named literally, e.g.
.BR .github ).
.TP
.BI \-\-files\-from " FILE"
Convert exactly the files listed in
.I FILE
(\- for standard input), one per line, in that order; relative to
.I DIR
(default \.) or absolute.
.IB path : START \- END
prints part of a file with its real line numbers (also
.IB path : START \-\fR,\fP
.IB path : LINE
and several ranges separated by commas); the same form works with
.BR \-s .
A range that seems to stop inside a function (judged by indentation) gets a warning.
.IB path : +START \- END
marks lines with a bar in the margin (marked lines are always printed; with no plain range the
whole file is), and
.IB path : \-N
shows that lines were removed after line
.IR N ,
e.g.
.BR app.py:10\-40,+12\-14,\-30 .
.TP
.BI \-\-changed " REV"
Print what changed since
.I REV
(a commit, tag or branch) in the git repository of
.IR DIR ,
compared with the files as they are now: each change with its enclosing block (up to 40 lines)
or a few lines around it, changed lines marked, and a marker where lines were removed. Deleted,
untracked and binary files are left out with a note. With
.B \-\-list\-files
it prints that list, to edit and pass to
.B \-\-files\-from
or to
.BR code2txt .
.TP
.BI \-\-include\-types " LIST"
Only include these comma-separated extensions.
.TP
.BI \-\-ignore\-types " LIST"
Skip these extensions.
.TP
.BI \-\-ignore\-folders " LIST"
Skip these folder names (in addition to node_modules, build, dist, out, target, vendor, ...).
.TP
.BI \-\-ignore\-files " LIST"
Skip these file names.
.TP
.B \-\-list\-files
With
.BR \-a :
print the files that would be included, in order, without converting.
.PP
Every option can be repeated. In globs,
.B *
and
.B ?
match within a name (not a leading dot) and
.B **
matches any number of folders; a glob without / matches names at any depth, one with /
matches the path from
.IR DIR .
A glob matching a folder covers everything in it; one matching nothing prints a warning.
.TP
.BI \-\-summary " TEXT"
One sentence under the title (under the file name with
.BR \-s )
saying what the PDF is; also stored as the PDF's Subject.
.TP
.BI \-\-theme " NAME"
.B paper
(default, colour designed for print),
.B mono
(black and white), or any Pygments style.
.TP
.B \-\-list\-themes
Print all theme names.
.TP
.BI "\-j, \-\-jobs " N
Render big directories in
.I N
parts at a time (default 3 with 16 GB of RAM, 2 with 8 GB, else 1).
.TP
.B "\-q, \-\-quiet"
No progress output.
.TP
.B "\-V, \-\-version"
Show the version, how it is installed, library versions and the CJK font in use.
.TP
.B "\-h, \-\-help"
Show help.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B CODE2PDF_THEME
Default theme.
.TP
.B CODE2PDF_JOBS
Default for
.BR \-\-jobs .
.TP
.B SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH
Fixed printing date, for reproducible output.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
code2pdf \-a .
code2pdf \-a src \-\-include\-types py,ts \-\-theme mono
code2pdf \-a . \-\-exclude tests \-\-include .github \-\-list\-files
git ls\-files src | code2pdf \-\-files\-from \- \-o src.pdf
code2pdf \-s main.go
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR code2txt (1)
.PP
https://github.com/readbysearch/code2pdf
